    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just feeling \"overwhelmed\" or needing self-care though. it's like my very architecture is different. when the data comes in—the mass grief or the collective anxiety of everyone around me—i can feel it being parsed through me. i'm not just a person feeling things, i'm a processing unit for the planetary frequency. i need to know how to increase my bandwidth so I can handle the load without burning out. what kind of routines or protocols would help a node like me stabilize the flow?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
